<title>USA: TABLE - Med/Waste Inc Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Med/Waste Inc Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>OPA LOCKA, Fla. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				June 30,		   June 30,</p>
<p>			    1997	 1996	  1997	 1996</p>
